#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<getuid>()  returns the real user ID of the calling process."
msgstr ""
"B<getuid>() devuelve el identificador de usuario real del proceso invocante."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<geteuid>()  returns the effective user ID of the calling process."
msgstr ""
"B<geteuid>() devuelve el identificador de usuario efectivo del proceso "
"actual."

